                                "sense_id": "c748c679-aaff-3e49-8ddc-2ef534b48f28",
                                "text": "Unrepresentation, the selection of information in order not to reveal important and relevant facts to the reader, would be another factor. Absences and silences can misinform readers just as effectively as more obvious devices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39f8ee6d-473b-4f07-a615-0941a3b57c2d",
                                "sense_id": "c748c679-aaff-3e49-8ddc-2ef534b48f28",
                                "text": "[…] the unrepresentation of everything. Such pictures of nothing, or of nothingness, although certainly worthy of careful consideration, are not the subject of this book."
                            }
